👉 Program -> A program is a set of instructions written to perform a specific task.
👉 Programmer -> A programmer is a person who writes computer programs.
👉 Programming Language -> A programming language is a language used to communicate with a computer.

✅ Programming = Computer ko instructions dena.
✅ Program = Instructions ka collection.
✅ Programmer = Program likhne wala person.
✅ Programming Language = Computer se communicate karne ka medium.
✅ Computer sirf wahi kaam karta hai jo program me likha hota hai.

👉 C is a general-purpose, procedural, high-level programming language developed by Dennis Ritchie in 1972 at Bell Labs. 
   It is widely used for system programming, application development, and embedded systems because of its speed and efficiency.
👉 C was developed to create efficient and portable system software.

